<title>USA: NYC $528 mln MAC bonds repriced, yields lowered. [CORRECTED 20:20 GMT]</title>
<headline>NYC $528 mln MAC bonds repriced, yields lowered. [CORRECTED 20:20 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities said Wednesday it repriced Municipal Assistance Corp. for the City of New York's $528 million bond deal, lowering yields in several maturities.</p>
<p>(Corrects underwriter from Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. to JP Morgan Securities)</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
